gametitle=Grand Theft Auto: San Andreas (NTSC-U SLUS-20946 / CRC 399A49CA)
comment=Work in progress. Adds an on-foot first-person view with free vertical look.
comment=Use First Person - Free Vertical Look as the main group. The optional Hide Body group hides CJ's body while keeping weapons on their normal draw path.
comment=Switch camera to restore the body. Fully restart with the relevant cheat disabled to completely remove its hooks.
comment=Disable other camera cheats while using this patch.

[Cheats\First Person - Free Vertical Look]
author=Zeroable
description=Closest on-foot camera with free vertical look. Default distance -2.35; height +0.65. Disable other camera cheats. Fully restart the game with this cheat disabled to completely remove the patch.
