[Cheats\First Person - Hide Body]
author=Zeroable
description=Optional whole-body hiding in the closest on-foot free-look view. Requires First Person - Free Vertical Look. Weapons use their normal draw path. Switch camera to restore the body; fully restart with this option disabled to uninstall its hooks.
